flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md S2, S3, H-02, MVP; business-analysis.md FR-02/FR-04.

    start([Start: Prompt Owner or contributor changes a prompt])
    detail[Prompt Detail]
    permission{Permission to edit?\nRules: Unverified / TBD}
    denied[Access Unavailable]
    editor[Revision Editor]
    save{Save succeeds?\nFailure behavior: Unverified / TBD}
    failure[Unverified / TBD: Save Failed]
    draft[Draft Revision Saved]
    history[Revision History]
    compare[Side-by-Side Diff]
    next{Next goal}
    end_draft([End: immutable Draft and activity preserved])
    end_view([End: revision history understood])
    evaluation([End: continue to Evaluation Evidence flow])

    start -->|Open prompt| detail
    detail -->|Edit| permission
    permission -->|No| denied
    denied -->|Return to prompt| detail
    permission -->|Yes| editor
    editor -->|Save change| save
    save -->|No| failure
    failure -->|Retry| editor
    failure -->|Cancel| detail
    save -->|Yes: automatic snapshot, editor, timestamp| draft
    draft --> next
    detail -->|View revisions| history
    history -->|Compare current and earlier revision| compare
    compare --> next
    next -->|Edit again| editor
    next -->|Keep Draft| end_draft
    next -->|Finish reviewing history| end_view
    next -->|Prepare review evidence| evaluation
